@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

User -> System: asks to open the Library
System --> User: shows the saved albums (most recent first)\nor informs that the Library is empty
opt user selects an album
  User -> System: selects an album
  System --> User: shows the album details
end

note right of System
  The list is reloaded every time the screen is
  shown, so changes made elsewhere are reflected.
end note
@enduml
